{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore and Fight</h2><strong>Our Metal Bowl</strong> is an action-adventure game with strong elements of exploration and combat. Together with <strong>XIU</strong>, your trusted robot companion, you will venture into a complex system of greenhouses, now abandoned and lifeless. Face enemies and unlock new areas, as you try to recover the essential nutrients to restore life.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117010/extras/ca6990c2ad28f269a32f78c97c175d6a.poster.avif?t=1767976392\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117010/extras/ca6990c2ad28f269a32f78c97c175d6a.webm?t=1767976392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117010/extras/ca6990c2ad28f269a32f78c97c175d6a.mp4?t=1767976392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve Puzzles</h2>It is not enough to find the nutrients: you must also <strong>figure out how to use them</strong>. Your main goal is to revitalize the greenhouses, but to do so you will have to solve logical and deductive puzzles: each greenhouse requires a precise combination and quantity of ingredients. Carefully search for hidden clues in the surrounding environment to calculate the exact doses and recreate the ecosystem.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117010/extras/17a129527b2756490b418f2b7d194a0f.poster.avif?t=1767976392\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117010/extras/17a129527b2756490b418f2b7d194a0f.webm?t=1767976392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117010/extras/17a129527b2756490b418f2b7d194a0f.mp4?t=1767976392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade and Progress</h2>Explore an <strong>intricate and interconnected map</strong>, full of shortcuts and secrets to uncover. As you progress, you will unlock <strong>upgrades</strong> for both you and XIU. Improve your movement capabilities, weapons, and defenses to overcome more hostile areas.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117010/extras/f9efaa68987f28ad06822f6712cf9dda.poster.avif?t=1767976392\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117010/extras/f9efaa68987f28ad06822f6712cf9dda.webm?t=1767976392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117010/extras/f9efaa68987f28ad06822f6712cf9dda.mp4?t=1767976392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Non-Linear Exploration</strong>: Venture into a complex system of interconnected rooms.<br></li><li> <strong>Tense Combat:</strong> Fast-paced combat in confined spaces.<br></li><li> <strong>Logical and Deductive Puzzles:</strong> Find the exact nutrient doses using environmental clues.<br></li><li> <strong>Intricate Map:</strong> Discover shortcuts, hidden paths, and new areas.<br></li><li> <strong>RPG Progression:</strong> Unlock fundamental upgrades for you and XIU.<br></li><li> <strong>Secrets to Uncover:</strong> Find collectibles and hidden passages in every corner.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117010/extras/7841cf652e9d3735b42feab8a2613f58.poster.avif?t=1767976392\" width=1170 height=658 ><sour